{"chapters":[{"title":"Check each candidate against all trust pairs","code":"def find_judge(n, trust):\n    for p in range(1, n + 1):\n        if any(a == p for a, _ in trust):\n            continue\n        if sum(1 for a, b in trust if b == p) == n - 1:\n            return p\n    return -1","frames":[{"caption":"<strong>Check each candidate against all trust pairs</strong> &mdash; O(n &middot; t) time, O(1) extra space. Input: <code>find_judge(n=4, trust=[[1, 3], [1, 4], [2, 3], [2, 4], [4, 3]])</code>. Step through to watch the code work on this input.","line":1,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"trust","label":"trust","v":["1,3","1,4","2,3","2,4","4,3"],"cls":["","","","",""]}],"vars":[["n","4",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>for p in range(1, n + 1):</code> &mdash; <code>p = 1</code>","line":2,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"trust","label":"trust","v":["1,3","1,4","2,3","2,4","4,3"],"cls":["","","","",""]}],"vars":[["n","4",0],["p","1",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>if any(a == p for a, _ in trust):</code> &mdash; calls <code>&lt;genexpr&gt;()</code>","line":3,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"trust","label":"trust","v":["1,3","1,4","2,3","2,4","4,3"],"cls":["","","","",""]}],"vars":[["n","4",0],["p","1",0]],"stack":["find_judge(n=4, trust)","<genexpr>()"]},{"caption":"<code>if any(a == p for a, _ in trust):</code> &mdash; yields <code>T</code>; <code>a = 1</code>; <code>_ = 3</code>","line":3,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"trust","label":"trust","v":["1,3","1,4","2,3","2,4","4,3"],"cls":["","","","",""]}],"vars":[["n","4",0],["p","1",0],["a","1",1],["_","3",1]],"stack":["find_judge(n=4, trust)","<genexpr>()"]},{"caption":"<code>continue</code>","line":4,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"trust","label":"trust","v":["1,3","1,4","2,3","2,4","4,3"],"cls":["","","","",""]}],"vars":[["n","4",0],["p","1",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>for p in range(1, n + 1):</code> &mdash; <code>p = 2</code>","line":2,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"trust","label":"trust","v":["1,3","1,4","2,3","2,4","4,3"],"